ough composed differently, communicates the same financial report - the rise in share price of Smithfield on the New York Stock Exchange. The alternative structure and slight rephrasing do not alter the main message or the data provided - demonstrating the flexibility in language when representing the same concept or event. Consequently, it is accurate to state that these two sentences indeed denote the same thing."}]}
