lculate the fifth result.\nNow, we can find the fifth result by subtracting the sum of the first four results from the sum of the first five results:\n\nFifth result = Sum of first 5 results - Sum of first 4 results\nFifth result = 245 - 241\nFifth result = 4\n\nSo, the fifth result is 4 (Option A)."}]}
