elp.\n\nOn May 19th, the police went to the place where the SOS rocks were found. They looked everywhere, but they didn't find anyone! They did find what looked like an old camping site, but there was no sign of any recent people being there. It's like when you find an old toy in the attic that you forgot you had – it has been there for a long time!\n\nA man named Sgt. Peter Reeves from the police said, \"We've looked on the ground and in the sky, and it seems like someone might have camped here a long time ago. But we don't know for sure how long ago that was.\" The police are still trying to find more clues and see if anyone is missing nearby. They're not sure if the SOS signal was real, or if someone made it as a joke. So the mystery of the SOS rocks in Swift Bay continues!"}]}
