rsion of the work.  The other performances (24 April 1707, 8 April 1708, and 9 April 1724) were performed without brass instruments (i.e., Cornetto and three Trombones). The first version (1707 and 1708) concluded with the words of...\nAnswer:"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "The brass instruments were only used for the 1 April 1725 version of the work, Christ lag in Todes Banden."}]}
