t entertaining.\n5. The comedic skills of the actors, particularly Adam DeVine, contribute to the movie's success.\n6. The movie includes some singing due to the involvement of stars from \"High School Musical\" and \"Pitch Perfect.\"\n7. Despite its absurdity, the film occasionally offers clever insights, such as the attractiveness of teachers."}]}
